          "desc": "Same 4 Tensor Cores per SM (568 total) and same FP8 + structural-sparsity hardware as L40. NVIDIA markets this as the 'Transformer Engine' on L40S. The headline difference from L40: NVIDIA's published FP8 TFLOPS for L40S (733 / 1,466 with sparsity) are roughly double L40's listed figures (362 / 724), reflecting L40S's higher sustained boost clocks under its 350W AI power budget rather than any change in Tensor Core count or design.",
